@K8sLab_HostAddress = http://localhost:5103

### Node and pod that answered, plus the env label used across all telemetry
GET {{K8sLab_HostAddress}}/api/info
Accept: application/json

### What Alloy scrapes: built-in ASP.NET Core metrics plus api_info_requests_total
GET {{K8sLab_HostAddress}}/metrics
